        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Fragment from the series \"The Story of the Holy Sacrament.\"  This tapestry depicts a Jew buying a host from unfaithful Christian behind wall next to house.  Below a dog is shown biting the hand of the Jew with the host on ground in front, Christians behind.  Descriptive inscription below scene. Condition: faded, areas of reweaving throughout; 8-10cm missing from left, 18-20 cm missing from right.   See related tapestries: 04.76, 1974.608 and 1974.610."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/2d5b5474-7720-35fc-b201-37feebbe8ee6> ;
